#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "My SMS won't send. What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "Make sure the <b>SMS</b> plugin is enabled in KDE Connect settings for your paired device."
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "The unread message badge doesn't appear. Why?"
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "The unread badge counts unread SMS conversations from your phone. The <b>SMS</b> plugin must be enabled in KDE Connect settings. The count updates every 60 seconds and refreshes when you open the widget."
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "No contacts appear when I type a name. How do I fix this?"
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "Your contacts must be synced to your local address book (KPeople). Enable the <b>Contacts</b> plugin in KDE Connect and click the sync button in the widget footer. Contacts from NextCloud, Google, or other synced sources also work."
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "How do I reply to an incoming SMS?"
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "Use KDE's native notification popup — it appears when you receive a message and includes a reply field. You can also open the full conversation window by clicking the conversations button in the widget."
msgstr ""

